# Agent Execution Efficiency

- Avoid redundant repository-wide scans.
- Inspect only files directly relevant to the requested task.
- Prioritize implementation over repeated investigation.
- Do not repeatedly run unchanged tests.
- Run targeted regression tests before full test suites.
- Set appropriate timeouts for external API requests.
- Do not retry failed operations more than twice without investigating the underlying cause.
- Avoid repeatedly reading unchanged files.
- Do not expand the implementation scope unnecessarily.
- Report blockers instead of entering indefinite retry loops.
- Preserve existing functionality and validation requirements.
